{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんばんはヽ(｡･ω･｡)ﾉ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この前オフの日に友達と\nいちご狩り行ってきました♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ん～おいし～♡"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/manatsu.akimoto/img/files/46/_pre/blog/manatsu.akimoto/img/2016/04/11/8286991/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"へた咥えてみた(｡･ω･)"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/manatsu.akimoto/img/files/46/_pre/blog/manatsu.akimoto/img/2016/04/11/8286991/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんだかマヌケな顔だね。笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どれくらい食べたか数えよ！って\nことになり、私は53個\n友達は61個食べました(((っ･ω･)っ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"多いのか少ないのかわからないヾ(-ω-*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いちご狩りのあとは友達が、\n私がずっとお花見に行きたいって\n言ってたのを覚えててくれて\nレジャーシートとかを\n持ってきてまだギリギリ\n桜が咲いてる公園に\n連れてってくれました♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/manatsu.akimoto/img/files/46/_pre/blog/manatsu.akimoto/img/2016/04/11/8286991/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"わーい！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"シャボン玉もしたよヽ(｡･ω･｡)ﾉ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/manatsu.akimoto/img/files/46/_pre/blog/manatsu.akimoto/img/2016/04/11/8286991/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"肺活量がないからシャボン玉も\nすごい下手です笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これに限らず私が\n上手にできることって\nなかなか少ないってことに\n最近気づいた(´｡･o･｡`)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"知り合ってから10年以上の親友で\nこの前の乃木のので話してた\n中学入って私がカバンを勝手に持ってって\n最初にできた友達はこの子です(∩^ω^∩)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちなみにいちご狩りとか\nお花見とかしてる最中も"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「ほら、ブログの写真撮ってあげるよ」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とか"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「動画も撮るから載せな」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とか言いながら\nたくさん撮ってくれたよー♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私の周りはしっかり者さんが\n多くて助かります(*^^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私もちゃんとしなくては！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あ、なので755に動画もアップするね～♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お花見のあとは猫アレルギーだけど\n行ってみたかった猫カフェに行ったり、\n鉄板焼きのお店で夜ご飯を食べたり♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/manatsu.akimoto/img/files/46/_pre/blog/manatsu.akimoto/img/2016/04/11/8286991/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"にゃんっ♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最後にNON STYLEの井上さんの\nプリクラ機でプリクラを\n何年か振りに撮りました(人-ω-)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"22ちゃいのまなったんは\n最新機器について行くのに必死でした...笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんな感じで\n朝から夜までオフを\n満喫したよ～\\( ^^)/\\(^^ )/"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"たまにはこういう息抜きも\n必要だねヽ(｡･v･｡)ﾉ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私、1人で居るとずーーんってなる人なので\n最近は極力外に出るようにしてます♪♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさんも最近\n春らしいことしましたか～？？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今週末は握手会もあるので\n来てくださるみなさんを\n笑顔にさせることができるように、\n楽しませられるように、\n私も元気に楽しんで\n頑張ろうと思います(*^^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"と、そんなこんなで\n珍しくお仕事モードゼロな\nブログでした～(∩^ω^∩)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"たまにはこんなのもいいかな？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"じゃあまたね♪"}],"source":"archive"}